# What myadhd.my does not serve.
#
# There is no build step, so Vercel deploys the checkout as it stands and
# every file in it gets a URL — CLAUDE.md, the SQL, the competitor notes and
# the poll log were all fetchable from the brand's own domain. None of it is
# secret (the GitHub repo is public), but none of it is the website either,
# and it should not be served or indexed as myadhd.my.
#
# Kept on purpose: package.json (api/ installs its dependencies from it),
# archive/ (waves-lab.html loads archive/waves.js), animation/app/ (the
# app's loading video), icons/*.png|svg, avatar-faces/.

# notes, plans, briefs and house rules — BRAND.md, README.md, CLAUDE*.md, docs/**/*.md
*.md
docs/
sql/
tools/
.claude/

# sources and scripts behind assets that do ship
animation/source/
components/
icons/*.py
icons/*.swift
serve.py

# the iOS shell's old home; it has its own repo now
ios/
